  "cited_article_id": "configure-online-appointment-booking",
  "reply": "To limit what patients can book, first enable online booking (Settings > Patient Portal > Booking Rules → toggle on “Allow Online Appointment Booking”). Then, in Scheduling > Visit Types, select only the routine visit types you want available and check “Available Online”. Finally, under Settings > Schedule > Provider Availability, choose the specific providers who should appear for online requests. Ensure those providers have published schedule templates and active rooms (Settings > Facility > Rooms)."
}
